<span id="A5.p38.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:49.72em;">
<span id="A5.p38.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.p38.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Based on the expert’s guidance, I need to focus on how rational numbers are handled when lambdifying expressions with the mpmath module. Let’s examine the relevant parts of the code:
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A5.p38.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">str_replace_editor view /testbed/sympy/utilities/lambdify.py --view_range 45 71</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
