<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A5.p79.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">ask_expert_llm ’The _EvaluatorPrinter class in lambdify.py doesn’"’"’t seem to have a _print_Rational method defined. It inherits from LambdaPrinter. Where should I look for the implementation of how rational numbers are handled during lambdification, especially for the mpmath module case?’</span></span></span>
